flowchart LR
    Client[Internet client] --> DNS[DNS]
    DNS --> ALB[ALB HTTPS listener]
    ALB --> TG[IP target group]
    TG --> UI[UI Pod VPC IP]
    UI --> SVC[Catalog Service ClusterIP]
    SVC --> EP[EndpointSlice]
    EP --> Catalog[Catalog Pod VPC IP]
    Catalog --> AWSAPI[AWS API or data service]

    subgraph PrivateSubnets[Private subnets]
      UI
      Catalog
    end

    PrivateSubnets --> NAT[NAT Gateway]
    NAT --> IGW[Internet Gateway]
